OL,3,A'Great result for Canada', says Carney
OL,4,Aas Alberta votes to reject separatism
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney says an
OL,7,Foverwhelming vote by people in Alberta
OL,8,Fto remain part of Canada is a "great
OL,9,Fresult" for the country.
OL,11,FSpeaking to reporters as he walked into
OL,12,Fa cabinet meeting on Tuesday, Carney
OL,13,Fsaid he was "thrilled that Albertans
OL,14,Fhave chosen unity" by rejecting a
OL,15,Fproposal to pursue separation through a
OL,16,Fbinding referendum.
OL,18,FPreliminary results indicate more than
OL,19,Ftwo-thirds chose Canada over a push for
OL,20,Findependence for the province,
OL,21,Faccording to Elections Alberta.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
